{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 8, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: f(x) = x^2\n  ucas: show f\nf(x: real) = x^2\n  -> real\n  ucas: range f\nrange of f:\n  [0, 100]   min at x ≈ 0, max at x ≈ -10\n  grid of 20001 points over [-10, 10] (default; give x a range), extrema refined at critical points\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 8, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "let f be x^2; what is the range of f?", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["f(x) = x^2", "show f", "range f"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "show", "definition": "f(x: real) = x^2", "body": "x^2", "type": "real"}, {"kind": "range", "empty": false, "min": 0, "max": 100, "argmin": 0, "argmax": -10, "points": 20001, "undefined_points": 0, "nan_points": 0, "inf_points": 0, "method": "grid, extrema refined at critical points"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "numeric", "text": "a grid of points, extrema refined where the derivative changes sign"}, "files": [], "text": "  ucas: f(x) = x^2\n  ucas: show f\nf(x: real) = x^2\n  -> real\n  ucas: range f\nrange of f:\n  [0, 100]   min at x ≈ 0, max at x ≈ -10\n  grid of 20001 points over [-10, 10] (default; give x a range), extrema refined at critical points\n"}, "isError": false}}
